# Terraform Standards

## Region & cost safety
- Region: `eu-central-1` (Frankfurt) for all labs
- Free-tier defaults: `t3.micro` / `db.t3.micro`
- Never suggest: NAT Gateway, Multi-AZ RDS, instances larger than `t3.micro`, EKS

## Tagging — every resource
```hcl
locals {
  common_tags = {
    Owner   = var.student_name
    Course  = "LIFE-DevOps"
    Lecture = "03-iac-cloud"
    Lab     = "XX-name"
    Managed = "terraform"
  }
}
```
Use `tags = local.common_tags` (or merge with resource-specific tags via `merge()`).

## Variables & outputs
- Every variable must have `description` and `type`
- Every output must have `description`
- Sensitive outputs: `sensitive = true`

## Pinning
- Pin providers in `versions.tf`
- Pin modules: `version = "~> X.Y"`

## Lab-specific settings
```hcl
# RDS — allow destroy without snapshot
skip_final_snapshot  = true
deletion_protection  = false

# ECR — allow destroy with images present
force_delete = true
```

## Never commit
- `*.tfstate`, `*.tfstate.backup`
- `*.tfvars` (commit only `*.tfvars.example`)
- AWS credentials, `.pem` files, access keys

## Critical cost items — NEVER auto-suggest
- `enable_nat_gateway = true` ($32/mo idle)
- `multi_az = true` on RDS (doubles cost)
- Instance types larger than `t3.micro`
- Detached Elastic IPs
